{"id":"m4-028","m":4,"paper":"2016年上海市公务员录用考试《行测》题（A类）","region":"上海","year":2016,"q":9,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"1758856","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>小张购买艺术品A，在其价格上涨<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5c3692576c06b56d.png\" />后卖出盈利<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9382bf2545819964.png\" />元，用卖价的一半购买艺术品B，又在其价格上涨<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5c3692576c06b56d.png\" />后卖出盈利<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-242e6569fa0745c2.png\" />元,发现<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-242e6569fa0745c2.png\" />大于<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9382bf2545819964.png\" />。则X的取值范围是（  ）。</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"大于100"},{"k":"B","t":"大于200"},{"k":"C","t":"小于100"},{"k":"D","t":"小于200"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：利润=成本×利润率。根据题干条件可得方程：</p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-14d9140ab5f8f373.png\" />；<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-acfb6f6d06fa6596.png\" />。因<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-899bf4482a59e2c0.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8eb8d5e1eeb64950.png\" />，将<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-013bea8fb4ecf5a0.png\" />代入不等式方程后，化简可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f84288bea638b9f7.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9f031f0419ff16a6.png\" />，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-959aa333067378bc.png\" />。</p><p>方法二：因题干未出现任何具体数值，故可赋值解题。设艺术品成本为1，根据<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-187ceb088ee2f1a5.png\" />得出<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-82816c970d0814fa.png\" />，代入不等式方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c5e7956c167396dd.png\" />，可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-959aa333067378bc.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"1805090","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某大型社区提供巴士换乘地铁服务，规定车满载后直达地铁站，中间站不再停留上客。如果巴士共有座位48个，第一站上来1人，第二站2人，第三站3人，按照这个规律，第（  ）站司机将不再停车。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"8"},{"k":"B","t":"9"},{"k":"C","t":"10"},{"k":"D","t":"11"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>依据条件，第一站上来1人，第二站2人，第三站3人······，每次上来的人数呈等差数列，故根据等差数列求和公式可得，在第n站时车上一共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b8ef6fe07ded276.png\" />人。因当满载时将不再停车，车上共有48座位，故当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-319a0df26857546f.png\" />≥48人时不再停车。当n=9时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b8ef6fe07ded276.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a5ae2cfa3a6ba3a9.png\" />人，不满足要求；当n=10时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b8ef6fe07ded276.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c20b93ee13ad14a2.png\" />人，满足要求。即在第十站停车上人后，人数达到55人，满载，从第11站开始将不再停车。<br></p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"1758848","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一艘轮船先顺水航行40千米，再逆水航行24千米，共用了8小时。若该船先逆水航行20千米，再顺水航行60千米，也用了8小时。则在静水中这艘船每小时航行（  ）千米。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"11"},{"k":"B","t":"12"},{"k":"C","t":"13"},{"k":"D","t":"14"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设船在静水中的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />千米/小时，水流的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" /><span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">千米/小时</span>，根据题干条件可得方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-310953ee8240d28d.png\" />。方程化简后得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e30e300f445c1282.png\" />。将<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e30e300f445c1282.png\" />代入原式，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b2cf47d9b26b2ed2.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-af59f44128f2e1cb.png\" />。</p><p>备注：【秒杀计】两方程联立化简后可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e30e300f445c1282.png\" />，结合题干数据和选项均为整数，故可猜测<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />应为3的倍数，只有B项满足。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"1758850","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某收藏家有三个古董钟，时针都掉了，只剩下分针，而且都走得较快，每小时分别快2分钟、6分钟及12分钟。如果在中午将这三个钟的分针都调整指向钟面的12点位置，多少小时后这3个钟的分针会指在相同的分钟位置？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"24"},{"k":"B","t":"26"},{"k":"C","t":"28"},{"k":"D","t":"30"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可得：假设每小时快2分钟、快6分钟、快12分钟的古董钟分别为A钟、B钟、C钟，则B钟与A钟速度差为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-097ad9e3c850f6e2.png\" />分钟/小时，已知整个钟盘有60分钟，即经过<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6da53937dd3f4d0f.png\" />小时，B钟的分针比A钟的分针恰好多走一圈，且此时两钟分针重合，同理，C钟与A钟速度差为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e893fa8e5a752fb5.png\" />分钟/小时，即经过<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1d8fa19ad8c0acc1.png\" />小时，C钟的分针比A钟的分针恰好多走一圈，此时两钟分针重合，取6和15的最小公倍数30，即经过30小时，B钟的分针比A钟的分针恰好多走2圈，C钟的分针比A钟的分针恰好多走5圈，且此时三个分针处于同一个位置。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"1805094","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>长方形ABCD，从图示的位置开始沿着AP每秒转动90度（无滑动情况），AB=4厘米，BC=3厘米，当长方形的右端到达距离A为46厘米的位置时是（    ）秒后。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/180843de45eb2e8.jpg\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"11"},{"k":"B","t":"12"},{"k":"C","t":"13"},{"k":"D","t":"14"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>开始的时候，长方形的右端距离A点为4cm，故只需通过滑动46-4=42cm的距离即可满足题目要求。从第一秒开始，每次滑动的距离分别为3cm、4cm、3cm、4cm······，即每两秒滑动7cm。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-019d37e8907cea3f.png\" />次，故所需的时间=6×2=12秒。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"1805096","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"现有21本故事书要分给5个人阅读，如果每个人得到的数量均不相同，那么得到故事书数量最多的人至少可以得到（   ）本。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"5"},{"k":"B","t":"7"},{"k":"C","t":"9"},{"k":"D","t":"11"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设得到数量最多的人得到了x本书。要使最多的人尽可能的少，则其他人应尽可能多，而每人得到的数量均不相同，可设分别比最多的少了1本、2本、3本、4本，则可得5x-10=21，解得x=6.2，故得到数量最多的人至少应得到7本书。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/155be1c734602c9.png\" /></p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"1758844","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲乙丙三员工共同修剪6060平方米草地，甲的修剪效率为30平方米/分钟，乙的修剪效率为40平方米/分钟，丙的效率为60平方米/分钟。上午，甲7点30分开始修剪，乙7点45分开始，丙8点15分开始，他们同一时间完成工作，乙用了（  ）分钟。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"56"},{"k":"B","t":"57"},{"k":"C","t":"58"},{"k":"D","t":"59"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>三人同一时间完成工作，且甲、乙分别先于丙45、30分钟开始工作。设任务完成时丙共工作了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />分钟，则甲应工作了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9e98f02c69fc41df.png\" />分钟，乙应工作了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2200e1a61c546cb0.png\" />分钟。工程总量<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b5bcd699eca08cbe.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2835763741622e06.png\" />，则乙工作了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1950842920707f8b.png\" />分钟。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"1805100","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>下图中间阴影部分为长方形。它的四周是四个正方形，这四个正方形的周长和是320厘米，面积和是1700平方厘米，则阴影部分的面积是（   ）平方厘米。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/181466726ed907f.png\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"375"},{"k":"B","t":"400"},{"k":"C","t":"425"},{"k":"D","t":"430"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设阴影部分长方形的长为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />厘米，宽为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />厘米，面积即为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a89851472b15c659.png\" />。四周四个正方形的周长<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b2f4238aab5c47ba.png\" />，化简后得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-01bbbfac11c3f87c.png\" />；四周四个正方形的面积<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2d9ef45d5d70fa00.png\" />，化简后得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3c3bde1f3d7638a4.png\" />。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6e4a1ceb3a7b8162.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c267bec3a90a970e.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-03e69c13d14d5a16.png\" />平方厘米。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"1758846","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"小王打算购买围巾和手套送给朋友们，预算不超过500元，已知围巾的单价是60元，手套的单价是70元，如果小王至少要买3条围巾和2双手套，那么不同的选购方式有（  ）种。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3"},{"k":"B","t":"5"},{"k":"C","t":"7"},{"k":"D","t":"9"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>在保证必买3条围巾和2双手套的前提下，剩余购买情况不能超过<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-415d9d8a2fffd493.png\" />元。设围巾再次购买了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />条，手套再次购买了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />双，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-edcece27f530ca8d.png\" />，依次分析<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />的取值情况。</p><p>当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-930b9fef79da7f6a.png\" />时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />可取0、1、2，共3种方式；</p><p>当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6e10396444bf3306.png\" />时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />可取0、1，共2种方式；</p><p>当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2d46c0c2d0358868.png\" />时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />可取0，共1种方式；</p><p>当<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f8ec1983657b87e4.png\" />时，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />可取0，共1种方式。</p><p>即还有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-02a06c7f155de8b0.png\" />种购买方式。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"}]}]}